{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-52","no":"EP.52","tag":"第52话 · 樱花河畔的约定","title":"樱花河畔的约定","rev":2,"branch":"reality","beats":[{"id":"ep-52:1","s":"n","t":"星期一。Yeoni一下课就推着自行车去了河边。东边水畔，花落之前，全部线索只有这些。","bg":"river","bgm":"flowingLight","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"think"},"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"water","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:2","s":"n","t":"星期二，她经过三座桥。星期三，五座。哪里都没有白伞，只有樱花一天比一天少。"},{"id":"ep-52:3","s":"yeon","t":"花落完就结束了？占卜有这么不留情面吗？","x":"disappoint"},{"id":"ep-52:4","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用通知 · Kang Saebyeok：今天星期四，花落前的最后一天。Yeoni今日运势好。合婚咨询费以后再收 ]","im":true,"sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:5","s":"yeon","t":"还收什么咨询费。你知道东边水畔有几公里吗？先赔我的小腿再说。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-52:6","s":"n","t":"嘴上这么说，Yeoni还是踩着踏板。今天她故意穿了不成对的袜子，左脚黄色，右脚条纹。"},{"id":"ep-52:7","s":"yeon","t":"这是测试。真是他的话，肯定没法装作没看见。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:8","s":"n","t":"早晨穿上这双袜子时，Yeoni独自笑了。用这个找人，大概是世上最奇怪的侦查办法。"},{"id":"ep-52:9","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用通知 · 摩卡：找到了吗？没找到我用说唱给你打气。Yo yo，姓Park的你在哪儿 ]","sfx":"chime"},{"id":"ep-52:10","s":"yeon","t":"这哪是打气，分明是捣乱。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:11","s":"n","t":"河风吹来，堤道边的樱花树落下一捧花瓣。Yeoni数了几片便停下，越数越焦急。"},{"id":"ep-52:12","s":"yeon","t":"要是花落完就真的结束了怎么办？他还不认识我呢。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:13","s":"n","t":"Yeoni握紧车把。掌心正中微微发暖，是那片金曾停留的位置。"},{"id":"ep-52:14","s":"n","t":"下午四点，第七座桥。Yeoni一屁股坐在河边长椅上，小腿几乎要炸了。自行车倒在旁边。","bg":"bench","bgm":"teaHouse","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"disappoint"},"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:15","s":"yeon","t":"一星，宇宙客服一星。不，半星。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:16","s":"n","t":"Yeoni拿出记事本翻开：可能白发。执着于袜子。对星级评价敏感。白伞。猫毛过敏。往河边。"},{"id":"ep-52:17","s":"yeon","t":"明明写了这么多，却一点也想不起脸。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:18","s":"n","t":"正要合上本子，一片花瓣落在纸页间。Yeoni没有拂去，就让它夹在里面。"},{"id":"ep-52:19","s":"n","t":"这时，长椅另一端传来喷嚏声。Yeoni转过头。"},{"id":"ep-52:20","s":"n","t":"一把白伞倚着长椅，旁边坐着个男人，膝上摊着书，脚边蜷着一只流浪猫。","im":true,"sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:21","s":"neo","t":"啊，抱歉。我对猫过敏。","x":"hneutral","r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:22","s":"yeon","t":"那怎么不赶走它？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-52:23","s":"neo","t":"它先坐在这里的。是它的位置。","x":"hcalm","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:24","s":"n","t":"男人有一绺头发是白的，不像染的，倒像天生如此。眼神冷淡，嗓音低沉。"},{"id":"ep-52:25","s":"n","t":"Yeoni屏住呼吸，心跳像冲到了耳边，怦怦作响。她还不能确定，世上有白头发的人多了。"},{"id":"ep-52:26","s":"neo","t":"你的自行车倒了。","x":"hneutral","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:27","s":"yeon","t":"啊，嗯，我知道。故意的。","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-52:28","s":"neo","t":"头一次见有人故意让车倒下。","x":"hsoft","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:29","s":"n","t":"男人垂眼继续看书，随后又停住。视线落在Yeoni的脚踝，黄色袜子与条纹袜子之间。","bg":"bench","shot":"close","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"shy"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:30","s":"neo","t":"那个，你的袜子不成对。","x":"hpoint","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"heartbeat","nm":"陌生男人","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:31","s":"n","t":"Yeoni没能答话，紧紧咬住嘴唇，眼睛发热。男人慌忙合上书。"},{"id":"ep-52:32","s":"neo","t":"啊，对不起，莫名说了这种话。我也不知道怎么就说出口了，对才见面的人……","x":"hache","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:33","s":"yeon","t":"没关系，以前天天听。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:34","s":"neo","t":"天天？谁说的？","x":"hneutral","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:35","s":"yeon","t":"一个很爱唠叨的人。起初以为只是只普通猫，其实不是，后来还变成了人。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:36","s":"n","t":"男人歪了歪头。这么难以置信的故事，他却没有一笑置之。看见那表情，Yeoni哭着哭着，忽然笑了。"},{"id":"ep-52:37","s":"neo","t":"那个人现在在哪儿？","x":"hsoft","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:38","s":"yeon","t":"回家了，很远的地方。连告别都那么敷衍。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:39","s":"neo","t":"看来他让你等了很久。","x":"hneutral","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:40","s":"yeon","t":"对吧？真的很不负责任。最后一句话居然是说袜子。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-52:41","s":"neo","t":"那确实有点过分。奇怪，我怎么觉得心虚呢。","x":"hache","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:42","s":"n","t":"男人不自觉地揉了揉太阳穴，像是头痛。Yeoni没有错过那个动作。"},{"id":"ep-52:43","s":"n","t":"不知不觉，两人走在了一起。他扶起倒下的自行车，她道了声谢谢，方向也一样。仅此而已。","bg":"cherryDay","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hcalm"},"fx":"stars","sfx":"sparkle","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"stars","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:44","s":"n","t":"樱花道沿河延伸很远。花瓣随风飞起，落在两人肩上，是最后的几片花瓣了。"},{"id":"ep-52:45","s":"neo","t":"能说件奇怪的事吗？最近，我总做同一个梦。","x":"hspeak","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:46","s":"yeon","t":"什么梦？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:47","s":"neo","t":"梦见和一个拿黄伞的人走在这条路上。有时还有一只猪，戴着粉红色的花。","x":"hsoft","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:48","s":"yeon","t":"猪？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-52:49","s":"neo","t":"以为是叫我买彩票的梦，就买了三次，全部没中。","x":"hcalm","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:50","s":"yeon","t":"那不是彩票梦，真的。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:51","s":"neo","t":"那是什么梦？你会解梦？","x":"hspeak","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:52","s":"yeon","t":"听说梦见猪，就会遇上贵人。我刚编的。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:53","s":"n","t":"男人一脸不明白她为什么笑。Yeoni却停不下来，一片花瓣挂在他的白发上。"},{"id":"ep-52:54","s":"yeon","t":"请问，你叫什么名字？","x":"serious","bg":"cherryDay","shot":"close","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-52:55","s":"neo","t":"Park Byeongha。你呢？","x":"hneutral","nm":"陌生男人"},{"id":"ep-52:56","s":"n","t":"Park Byeongha。Yeoni在心里轻轻念了一遍。第一次在恋人牌上读到的名字，那个据说一叫出口，他就会消失的名字。"},{"id":"ep-52:57","s":"n","t":"那是另一个世界的规则。Yeoni亲手在二十三号卡上写过，门，也能从里面打开。"},{"id":"ep-52:58","s":"yeon","t":"不过，那个名字是他起的。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:59","s":"n","t":"Yeoni摇了摇头。她要叫的，是另一个名字，是她自己起的，是押上一星评价起的名字。"},{"id":"ep-52:60","s":"yeon","t":"我叫Yeoni。还有，能拜托你一件事吗？","x":"gentle","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:61","s":"neo","t":"什么事？","x":"hneutral","nm":"Park Byeongha"},{"id":"ep-52:62","s":"yeon","t":"接下来，我要叫一个奇怪的名字。你可以不回答，只要听着就好。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-52:63","s":"yeon","t":"Neo。","x":"cry","bg":"cherryDay","bgm":"starsName","shot":"impact","fx":"reveal","sfx":"bell","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"cry"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"reveal","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-52:64","s":"n","t":"风停了。正落下的花瓣仿佛在半空稍作停留。Park Byeongha停下脚步。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"chime","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:65","s":"neo","t":"啊。","x":"hache","nm":"Park Byeongha"},{"id":"ep-52:66","s":"n","t":"他扶住额头，像在忍痛，闭上眼。合拢的眼皮下，有什么正飞快掠过。"},{"id":"ep-52:67","s":"n","t":"下雨的车站，翻过来的雨伞，床尾属于猫的位置，食伤之岛的太阳，金库里的龙蛋，淹在水中的书架，空亡里的白光。"},{"id":"ep-52:68","s":"n","t":"还有，在河上的船里，第一次握住他人类手掌的Yeoni。那时落在肩上的温度。","im":true,"fx":"thread","sfx":"sparkle","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"thread","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:69","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:70","s":"yeon","t":"嗯，是我，穿错袜子的那个。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:71","s":"neo","t":"星级想好了？不是说定好了就告诉我吗？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:72","s":"n","t":"说话的口气变了。冷淡，有点傲慢，末尾却莫名温柔。正是Yeoni熟悉的那种口气。"},{"id":"ep-52:73","s":"yeon","t":"五星。本来想因为迟到扣一星，忍住了。不过评价会写很长。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:74","s":"neo","t":"挺大方。","x":"hsmile"},{"id":"ep-52:75","s":"n","t":"Yeoni抓着他的衬衫哭了。Byeongha犹豫片刻，伸手环住她的背。这次，身体没有一处变模糊。","bg":"cherryDay","shot":"wide","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hsmile"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:76","s":"neo","t":"这次手不透明了。这样抱着你……没关系吧？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:77","s":"yeon","t":"头，摸头就好。这个你会吧。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:78","s":"neo","t":"还有，Yeoni，袜子怎么又不成对？","x":"harms"},{"id":"ep-52:79","s":"yeon","t":"这是测试。你通过了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:80","s":"n","t":"跟在脚边的流浪猫喵了一声。Park Byeongha打了个喷嚏，Yeoni笑出了声。"},{"id":"ep-52:81","s":"neo","t":"偏偏这过敏没变。回来时就不能顺便治一下吗？得给客服打个电话。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:82","s":"yeon","t":"给客服投诉吧。排队只有一个人，很快就能接通。","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-52:83","s":"yeon","t":"可是，你真全记得？作为那个姓Park的人的生活，还有作为Neo的事，两边都记得？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:84","s":"neo","t":"都记得。上班、交房租的Byeongha，陪在你身边的Neo，还有船上你握住的那只手。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:85","s":"neo","t":"奇怪，一点也不会混乱。大概因为，两个都是我。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:86","s":"yeon","t":"那怎么叫你？Byeongha？Neo？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:87","s":"neo","t":"用你给我起的名字吧，Yeongnyangi。在别人面前叫Byeongha。要是在公司叫Yeongnyangi，就得解释半天。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:88","s":"yeon","t":"本来没打算去你公司。现在有了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:89","s":"n","t":"Byeongha笑了，一边嘴角先翘起来，笑得有点笨拙。Yeoni觉得，这个表情自己不会再忘了。","im":true,"fx":"heart","sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:90","s":"n","t":"夕阳倾向河面，花瓣漂在水上，缓缓流去。两人并肩倚着河畔栏杆。","bg":"river","bgm":"firstLight","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hsmile"},"sfx":"water","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:91","s":"neo","t":"梦里走过这条路。一个普通的春天，和你。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:92","s":"yeon","t":"梦里我们做了什么？不会在吵架吧？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:93","s":"neo","t":"什么也没做，只是走着。那样最好。吵架，醒了才吵。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:94","s":"yeon","t":"那就约好，每年春天都来这里走走。花落之前，什么也不做。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:95","s":"neo","t":"约定就是拿来遵守的。要是下雨，伞由你撑，黄色那把。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:96","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用通知 · 徐寒雨：看海定在五月第二个星期六。可以再带一位，别带掉毛的那位 ]","im":true,"sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:97","s":"neo","t":"早就不掉毛了，怎么还说这事？","x":"hpoint"},{"id":"ep-52:98","s":"yeon","t":"你还打喷嚏啊。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:99","s":"n","t":"Yeoni回复：加一位。人类。不掉毛。负责检查袜子。"},{"id":"ep-52:100","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用通知 · Kang Saebyeok：找到了吧。今日运势算准了，现收取咨询费。另外，请问他的出生时辰 ]","sfx":"chime"},{"id":"ep-52:101","s":"neo","t":"这人怎么还问出生时辰？","x":"hpoint"},{"id":"ep-52:102","s":"yeon","t":"想看看咱俩合不合。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:103","s":"neo","t":"我们有乙庚合就够了。不是一起走到这里了吗？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:104","s":"yeon","t":"可还是会好奇呀，能打几分。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:105","s":"neo","t":"不是满分，就给那算命的一星。","x":"hsmile"},{"id":"ep-52:106","s":"n","t":"Yeoni笑着把手机放回口袋，牵起Park Byeongha的手。人的手比想象中大，也比想象中凉一点。"},{"id":"ep-52:107","s":"yeon","t":"手好凉。因为是庚金吗？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:108","s":"neo","t":"是你的手暖，因为是乙木。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:109","s":"n","t":"两人牵着手沿河走去。流浪猫远远跟在后面，Park Byeongha又打了个喷嚏。最后一片花瓣，顺着河水流远。"}]}
